Package: TensorPLS
Type: Package
Title: PLS-DA and Temporal VIP Analysis for Longitudinal Omics Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Alessandro", "Giordano", email = "alexjinnerjan@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Analyses longitudinal omics data using partial least squares
    discriminant analysis (PLS-DA) on matrices obtained by unfolding
    subject-by-feature-by-time tensors. Supports data preparation,
    missing-data imputation using feature-time means or Tucker3
    reconstruction, VIP-based feature selection, temporal interpretation
    of molecular importance, and subject-level nested cross-validation
    for predictive assessment. Includes gene-based functional enrichment
    analysis using Gene Ontology Biological Process, Reactome and MSigDB
    Hallmark gene sets with an explicit gene universe.
